    "title": "New Mexico Man Sentenced to Over 21 Years for Fentanyl Trafficking - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By America Today Staff ,\n19 hours ago A federal judge in El Paso has sentenced 43-year-old Edgar Omar Martinez of Anthony, New Mexico, to 262 months (over 21 years) in prison for trafficking approximately 1.5 kilograms of fentanyl. Martinez was arrested on March 14, 2025, after FBI agents discovered about 17,000 fentanyl pills in his vehicle. Court... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 4",
